emy-id "q-97349" :question/problem "Let $V={R}^{3}$ be the vector space equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x,y⟩=5{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.\n$$\n\nIf $x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]$ and \n$y=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}]$ are orthogonal with respect to the inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ in $V,$ then $k=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $x$ and $y$ are orthogonal, their inner product must be zero.\n\nFirst, we compute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =5{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+{x}_{3}{y}_{3} \\\\  & =5\\cdot (1\\cdot 2)+3\\cdot (4\\cdot 0)+(-5)\\cdot k \\\\  & =10+0-5k \\\\  & =10-5k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨x,y⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ 10-5k & =0 \\\\ 5k & =10 \\\\ k & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97349/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "46ebecec-2507-5893-8529-69e7bbd61765"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97349"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-97353"] :question/problem "Let $V={R}^{3}$ be the vector space equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x,y⟩={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+5{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.\n$$\n\nIf $x=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -5 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}]$ and $y=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ are orthogonal with respect to the inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ in $V,$ then $k=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $x$ and $y$ are orthogonal, their inner product must be zero.\n\nFirst, we compute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & ={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+5{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 5+5\\cdot ((-5)\\cdot 3)+2\\cdot (k\\cdot 5) \\\\  & =-15-75+10k \\\\  & =-90+10k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨x,y⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ -90+10k & =0 \\\\ 10k & =90 \\\\ k & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "bb2d1d52-0658-5175-b668-ddecf9f891b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "2bcbddcc-bffe-568d-9dc0-4426060e6fb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "137e6025-b0ec-5bf4-af31-49f25f365b25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "ab2fa789-f446-5e31-ba9f-ed5de92c3c40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "cd8dc75e-a928-54dc-aff0-fda23ba3579d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a1ee84d8-54bf-5961-b98d-13904f5e0a81" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97351/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-97351/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-97351/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" "q-97351/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-97351/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" "q-97351/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-97351" :question/id #uuid "62230b14-bfca-57a1-a47e-89266f3f9be7" :question/math-academy-id "q-97351" :question/problem "Let $V={R}^{3}$ be the vector space equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x,y⟩={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.\n$$\n\nIf $x=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and \n$y=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ k \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ are orthogonal with respect to the inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ in $V,$ then $k=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $x$ and $y$ are orthogonal, their inner product must be zero.\n\nFirst, we compute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & ={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{3}{y}_{3} \\\\  & =0\\cdot 3+3\\cdot ((-2)\\cdot k)+3\\cdot (2\\cdot 5) \\\\  & =0-6k+30 \\\\  & =-6k+30\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨x,y⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ -6k+30 & =0 \\\\ 6k & =30 \\\\ k & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97351/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "46ebecec-2507-5893-8529-69e7bbd61765"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97351"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97348/selection/f509030681214332b5989836fe0af4b2eb5858d193e689fd8441dff5cd45ff45" :answer/id #uuid "aed69dfb-76c5-5b4b-9e7b-4bf485c1a36c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97348/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "4050fd2a-ea89-5345-86e1-e09ad63be3cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97348/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "6a4ee05b-d42a-549c-bcc8-69166fbb010d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97348/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab