0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & =0 \\\\ 5k+50 & =0 \\\\ 5k & =-50 \\\\ k & =-10\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97348/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "46ebecec-2507-5893-8529-69e7bbd61765"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97348"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "7114cdcc-cefb-55e2-9524-c40317aa5aeb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "5210ba2b-28f1-51f1-8f6a-3ddfb59f0dfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" :answer/id #uuid "afb1e62a-45b7-5458-8037-cb6b0c204663" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "d5215913-fb90-5c30-a51f-37793720faf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection/c43b27454cd69f1b6f4b793e211f4f4f6e40314b87f5b1c35a69172a60fcd818" :answer/id #uuid "6108deba-1b88-57d9-b5a6-fc1a207fd4df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "78eb4ef2-c0a3-503a-9a97-e5a66430627e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97360/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" :answer-field/choices ["q-97360/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-97360/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-97360/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" "q-97360/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-97360/selection/c43b27454cd69f1b6f4b793e211f4f4f6e40314b87f5b1c35a69172a60fcd818"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-97360" :question/id #uuid "91fe5110-9319-5950-87cb-9762cb842dbc" :question/math-academy-id "q-97360" :question/problem "Let $V={R}_{2}[t]$ be the vector space of all polynomials of degree at most $2,$ equipped with the inner product \n\n$$\n⟨x(t),y(t)⟩=x(0)y(0)+x(1)y(1)+\\frac{1}{10}x(2)y(2).\n$$\n\nIf $p(t)=3+t$ and $q(t)=3t-k{t}^{2}$ are orthogonal with respect to the inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ in $V,$ then $k=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $p(t)$ and $q(t)$ are orthogonal, their inner product must be zero.\n\nFirst, we compute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =p(0)q(0)+2p(1)q(1)+\\frac{1}{10}p(2)q(2) \\\\  & =(3+0)(0)+(3+1)(3-k)+\\frac{1}{10}(3+2)(6-4k) \\\\  & =0+(12-4k)+(3-2k) \\\\  & =15-6k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨p(t),q(t)⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =0 \\\\ 15-6k & =0 \\\\ 6k & =15 \\\\ k & =\\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97360/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a348cfec-2c8f-5302-a94a-43a6c9330c34"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97360"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97356/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "1974b300-3fec-5370-8fde-23f0dddb3050" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97356/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "99acf4c2-dcec-58be-a50d-fe5d942c6be4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :d