pute the inner product using our definition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =p(1)q(1)+p(3)q(3) \\\\  & =(1-1)(k+3)+(3-1)(3k+3) \\\\  & =0+(6k+6) \\\\  & =6k+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we set $⟨p(t),q(t)⟩=0$ and solve for $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨p(t),q(t)⟩ & =0 \\\\ 6k+6 & =0 \\\\ 6k & =-6 \\\\ k & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97356/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a348cfec-2c8f-5302-a94a-43a6c9330c34"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97356"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "1d031099-a8bc-573b-b3ec-9df97a58020f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "dfae4369-ca37-5c71-a0f0-1818e499717c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "73e34b29-539c-5b1d-a149-4e4456b5d111" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "20597dcc-1d07-5d99-9ff6-962297c29789" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "39d45e59-978c-5c4a-b8ee-fb0fcbc4c57b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97363/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6459167-188c-5d54-8452-63d60a726e31" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97363/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93